10. Your First Business Calculation

Calculate gross sales:

SELECT
    order_id,
    product_id,
    quantity,
    unit_price,
    quantity * unit_price AS gross_sales
FROM bronze.sales;
| order_id | product_id | quantity | unit_price | gross_sales |
| -------: | ---------: | -------: | ---------: | ----------: |
|     1001 |        101 |        2 |        500 |        1000 |
|     1001 |        102 |        1 |        800 |         800 |
|     1002 |        101 |        3 |        500 |        1500 |
|     1003 |        103 |        1 |       1200 |        1200 |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

11. Calculate Net Sales

Now:

SELECT
    order_id,
    product_id,
    quantity,
    unit_price,
    discount_amount,
    quantity * unit_price AS gross_sales,
    quantity * unit_price - discount_amount AS net_sales
FROM bronze.sales;

The calculation is:

Net Sales
=
Quantity × Unit Price
-
Discount
