12. Important Data Analytics Pattern

You'll use this pattern constantly:

SOURCE COLUMN
     ↓
TRANSFORMATION
     ↓
DERIVED METRIC

Example:

quantity
   +
unit_price
   ↓
gross_sales

Then:

gross_sales
     -
discount
     ↓
net_sales

Then:

net_sales
cost
     ↓
profit















